[l_english.MODULE_PROJECTILE_6A_PLASMA]
Magictron Cloud

[l_english.MODULE_PROJECTILE_6A_PLASMA_desc]
Weaponized magictrons move in different orbitals, on each orbital its trajectories form a cloud of possibilities.
Some say each possibility represents a different universe, but I can assure you, in none of them your enemies survive.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PROJECTILE_6A_PLASMA]
魔法子云

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PROJECTILE_6A_PLASMA_desc]
武器化的魔法子在不同轨道上运动，每个轨道上的轨迹形成了一片可能性的云。
有说法是这每种可能性都代表了一个不同的宇宙，但我可以向你保证，没有哪个宇宙中你的敌方活下来了。
